===Etymology===
Uncertain, but likely from {{der|en|enm|fillen||to fill}} (from {{der|en|ang|fyllan}}) + {{m|enm|fot||foot}} (from {{der|en|ang|fōt}}), in reference to its use as a design to be placed at the bottom of stained-glass windows.

